    "seo.about.story":
      "<h2>Our Story</h2><p>Calculator12 was founded in 2020 with a simple yet powerful mission: to make mathematical and financial calculations accessible to everyone, everywhere. What started as a small collection of 10 calculators has grown into a comprehensive platform featuring 340+ tools used by millions of people across 100+ countries.</p><p>Our founder, a former financial analyst, experienced firsthand how confusing calculations could be when planning loans, investments, and taxes. Frustrated by the lack of simple, free tools, they decided to build Calculator12 — a platform where anyone could get instant, accurate results without registration fees or hidden costs.</p>",
    "seo.about.mission":
      "<h2>Our Mission</h2><p>To democratize access to calculation tools by providing 100% free, accurate, and user-friendly calculators that help people make informed decisions in finance, health, education, and daily life. We believe that everyone deserves access to reliable computational tools, regardless of their background or location.</p>",
    "seo.about.story":
      "<h2>Our Story</h2><p>Calculator12 was founded in 2020 with a simple yet powerful mission: to make mathematical and financial calculations accessible to everyone, everywhere. What started as a small collection of 10 calculators has grown into a comprehensive platform featuring 340+ tools used by millions of people across 100+ countries.</p><p>Our founder, a former financial analyst, experienced firsthand how confusing calculations could be when planning loans, investments, and taxes. Frustrated by the lack of simple, free tools, they decided to build Calculator12 — a platform where anyone could get instant, accurate results without registration fees or hidden costs.</p><p>Today, Calculator12 serves students, professionals, entrepreneurs, and everyday users who need quick, reliable answers. From calculating monthly EMI payments to tracking BMI, from converting units to planning investments, our platform has become a trusted companion for millions worldwide.</p>",

    "seo.about.mission":
      "<h2>Our Mission</h2><p>To democratize access to calculation tools by providing 100% free, accurate, and user-friendly calculators that help people make informed decisions in finance, health, education, and daily life. We believe that everyone deserves access to reliable computational tools, regardless of their background or location.</p><p>We envision a world where complex calculations are no longer a barrier to progress. Whether you're a student in rural India learning percentages, a small business owner in Brazil calculating taxes, or a parent in Japan planning their child's education fund — Calculator12 is here to help, in your language, on your device, at no cost.</p>",

    "seo.about.team":
      "<h2>Our Team</h2><p>Calculator12 is powered by a diverse team of mathematicians, software engineers, UX designers, and domain experts. Our developers ensure fast, reliable performance. Our mathematicians verify every formula. Our designers craft intuitive interfaces. Together, we create tools that millions trust daily.</p><p>Our team spans 15 countries, bringing diverse perspectives and cultural insights to every calculator we build. This global diversity ensures that our tools are not only mathematically accurate but also culturally relevant and accessible to users from different backgrounds.</p><p>We're a remote-first company that values work-life balance, continuous learning, and collaborative innovation. Every team member is passionate about making calculations simple and accessible for everyone.</p>",

    "seo.about.impact":
      "<h2>Our Impact</h2><ul><li><strong>1 Million+ Monthly Users:</strong> People from 195 countries trust our calculators for their daily needs.</li><li><strong>340+ Specialized Tools:</strong> Covering finance, health, math, science, lifestyle, and 20+ other categories.</li><li><strong>13+ Languages:</strong> Including English, Hindi, Spanish, French, German, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Vietnamese, and Indonesian.</li><li><strong>4.9/5 Average Rating:</strong> Consistently high user satisfaction scores across all platforms.</li><li><strong>100% Free Forever:</strong> No premium tiers, no hidden costs, no registration required — ever.</li><li><strong>Zero Data Collection:</strong> All calculations happen in your browser. We never store or transmit your personal information.</li></ul>",

    "seo.about.future":
      "<h2>Looking Ahead</h2><p>As we move forward, we're committed to expanding our calculator library, improving accuracy, and reaching even more users worldwide. We're exploring AI-powered insights, personalized recommendations, and mobile apps to make calculations even more accessible.</p><p>Our roadmap for 2026-2030 includes: launching native mobile apps for iOS and Android, adding 200+ new specialized calculators, expanding language support to 50+ languages, introducing AI-powered calculation assistants, building community features for users to share tips and insights, and partnering with educational institutions to provide free tools to students globally.</p><p>Our ultimate goal is to become the world's most trusted calculation platform by 2030 — a place where anyone, anywhere, can solve any calculation problem instantly, accurately, and for free.</p>",

    "seo.about.faq":
      "<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>Is Calculator12 really free?</h3><p>Yes, 100% free forever. No registration, no fees, no premium tiers. We're funded through ethical advertising that never compromises user experience.</p><h3>How do you ensure accuracy?</h3><p>Every calculator is built using industry-standard formulas and reviewed by domain experts. We conduct quarterly audits to maintain the highest accuracy standards.</p><h3>Can I suggest a new calculator?</h3><p>Absolutely! We love user feedback. Use our contact form to suggest new calculators, and we'll prioritize them based on user demand.</p><h3>Is my data safe?</h3><p>Completely safe. All calculations happen in your browser. We never collect, store, or transmit your personal information or calculation inputs.</p><h3>Do you offer API access?</h3><p>We're exploring API options for enterprise users. Contact partnerships@calculator12.com if you're interested in API access for your business.</p><h3>How can I support Calculator12?</h3><p>Share us with friends and family, leave reviews, suggest new calculators, and report any issues you find. Your support helps us grow and improve.</p>",
    "seo.about.values_title": "Our Core Values",
    "seo.about.value1_title": "Accessibility",
    "seo.about.value1_desc":
      "Free tools for everyone, no barriers, no hidden fees.",
    "seo.about.value2_title": "Accuracy",
