    "seo.careers.step5_desc":
      "Receive your offer, complete onboarding, and start making an impact from day one.",
    "seo.careers.remote":
      "<h2>Life as a Remote Team</h2><p>Being remote-first isn't just a policy at Calculator12 — it's part of our identity. We've built our culture around asynchronous communication, documented processes, and trust. You'll have the flexibility to work when you're most productive, whether that's early morning, late night, or somewhere in between.</p><p>We use tools like Slack for daily communication, Notion for documentation, Zoom for video calls, and GitHub for collaboration. Weekly team syncs keep everyone aligned, while monthly virtual socials and annual in-person retreats help us build genuine relationships. You'll never feel isolated — you'll feel connected to a global team that has your back.</p>",
    "seo.careers.diversity":
      "<h2>Diversity & Inclusion</h2><p>We believe that diverse teams build better products. Calculator12 is committed to creating an inclusive workplace where people of all backgrounds, genders, ethnicities, ages, abilities, and orientations feel welcome and valued. We actively recruit from underrepresented communities and ensure our hiring practices are fair and unbiased.</p><p>Our team includes members from India, USA, UK, Brazil, Germany, Japan, Nigeria, and many more countries. This diversity isn't just a number — it's reflected in the calculators we build, the languages we support, and the perspectives we bring to problem-solving every day.</p>",
    "seo.careers.growth":
      "<h2>Growth & Learning Opportunities</h2><p>We invest heavily in our team's growth. Every team member receives a $2,000 annual learning budget for courses, books, conferences, and certifications. We host monthly \"learning days\" where team members share knowledge, present projects, or explore new technologies.</p><p>Internal mobility is encouraged — many of our senior team members started in junior roles and grew into leadership positions. We provide mentorship programs, regular 1-on-1s with managers, and clear career ladders so you always know what's next in your journey with us.</p>",
    "seo.careers.testimonials_title": "Hear From Our Team",
    "seo.careers.testimonial1":
      '"Joining Calculator12 was the best career decision I\'ve made. The remote flexibility lets me spend time with my family while doing meaningful work that impacts millions."',
    "seo.careers.testimonial1_name": "Priya Sharma",
    "seo.careers.testimonial1_role": "Senior Frontend Engineer, India",
    "seo.careers.testimonial2":
      '"The culture here is incredible. Everyone is supportive, ideas are valued regardless of seniority, and we genuinely care about building something that helps people."',
    "seo.careers.testimonial2_name": "Marco Costa",
    "seo.careers.testimonial2_role": "UX Designer, Brazil",
    "seo.careers.testimonial3":
      '"I love that my work matters. Every calculator I build helps someone make an important decision. Plus, the learning budget has helped me grow tremendously."',
    "seo.careers.testimonial3_name": "Aisha Khan",
    "seo.careers.testimonial3_role": "Content Lead, UK",
    "seo.careers.apply":
      "<h2>How to Apply</h2><p>Ready to join us? We'd love to hear from you. Here's how to get started:</p><ul><li><strong>Check Open Positions:</strong> Visit our careers page or LinkedIn profile to see current openings that match your skills.</li><li><strong>Prepare Your Application:</strong> Update your resume and write a brief cover letter explaining why you're excited about Calculator12 and what you'd bring to the team.</li><li><strong>Submit Your Application:</strong> Email your application to careers@calculator12.com with the position title in the subject line.</li><li><strong>Wait for Our Response:</strong> We review all applications within 5 business days and will reach out if there's a potential fit.</li></ul><p>Don't see a role that matches your skills? We're always interested in hearing from talented people. Send us an open application with your resume and a note about what you'd love to work on, and we'll keep you in mind for future opportunities.</p>",
    "seo.careers.faq_title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "seo.careers.faq1":
      "<h3>Do you sponsor work visas?</h3><p>Currently, we're a fully remote company and don't sponsor visas. However, we hire globally as independent contractors or through Employer of Record services in select countries. If you're in a country where we don't have legal entity coverage, we can often work through platforms like Deel or Remote.com.</p>",
    "seo.careers.faq2":
      "<h3>What's the interview process like?</h3><p>Our process includes: initial application review, 30-minute screening call, practical skills assessment, team interview, and final culture fit discussion. The entire process takes 2-3 weeks, and we provide feedback at every stage.</p>",
    "seo.careers.faq3":
      "<h3>Do you offer internships?</h3><p>Yes! We offer paid internships for students and recent graduates in engineering, design, content, and data roles. Internships are typically 3-6 months and can lead to full-time positions. Check our careers page for current openings.</p>",
    "seo.careers.faq4":
      "<h3>What are the working hours?</h3><p>We're flexible! While we have core overlap hours (10 AM - 2 PM UTC) for team meetings, you're free to structure the rest of your day as you see fit. We care about results, not hours logged.</p>",
    "seo.careers.faq5":
      "<h3>Can I work part-time?</h3><p>We're open to part-time arrangements for certain roles, especially for experienced professionals. Mention your preference in your application, and we'll discuss what's possible during the interview process.</p>",
    "seo.careers.faq6":
      "<h3>What tech stack do you use?</h3><p>Our frontend is built with vanilla JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3 for maximum performance. We use Node.js for backend services, PostgreSQL for databases, and deploy on cloud infrastructure. We're always evaluating new technologies that could improve our platform.</p>",
    "seo.careers.cta_title": "Ready to Join Us?",
    "seo.careers.cta_desc":
      "Send your resume and a brief introduction to careers@calculator12.com. We can't wait to meet you!",
    "seo.careers.cta_button": "Apply Now",
    "breadcrumbs.privacy": "Privacy Policy",
    "page.privacy_title": "Privacy Policy - Calculator12",
    "page.privacy_hero_title": "Privacy Policy",
    "page.privacy_hero_desc":
      "Your privacy matters. We never collect or sell your personal data.",
    "page.privacy_updated": "Last Updated: January 1, 2026",
    "seo.privacy.intro":
      '<h2>Introduction</h2><p>Welcome to Calculator12 ("we," "our," or "us"). We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring that your personal information is handled in a safe and responsible manner. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website calculator12.com (the "Site").</p><p>Please read this Privacy Policy carefully. By accessing or using our Site, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by all the terms outlined in this policy. If you do not agree with our policies and practices, please do not use our Site.</p>',
