    "seo.privacy.key_point_title": "Key Point",
    "seo.privacy.key_point_desc":
      "All calculations happen entirely in your browser. Your calculation inputs and results are never sent to our servers, stored in our databases, or shared with any third party.",
    "seo.privacy.usage_title":
      "<h2>How We Use Information</h2><p>The limited information we collect is used solely to improve your experience on our Site. Specifically, we use this information to:</p><ul><li><strong>Improve Performance:</strong> Understand which calculators are most popular so we can optimize their performance and add similar tools.</li><li><strong>Fix Bugs:</strong> Identify and resolve technical issues to ensure smooth operation across all devices and browsers.</li><li><strong>Enhance User Experience:</strong> Remember your preferences (language, theme, currency) so you don't have to set them every time you visit.</li><li><strong>Develop New Features:</strong> Use anonymous usage patterns to guide our development roadmap and prioritize new calculator categories.</li><li><strong>Ensure Security:</strong> Monitor for suspicious activity and protect our Site from malicious attacks.</li></ul><p>We never use your information for targeted advertising, sell it to third parties, or share it with data brokers. Your privacy is our top priority.</p>",
    "seo.privacy.cookies_title": "Cookies and Local Storage",
    "seo.privacy.essential_cookies_title": "Essential Cookies",
    "seo.privacy.essential_cookies_desc":
      "These cookies are necessary for the Site to function properly. They enable basic functions like page navigation and access to secure areas. The Site cannot function properly without these cookies.",
    "seo.privacy.preference_cookies_title": "Preference Cookies",
    "seo.privacy.preference_cookies_desc":
      "These cookies enable the Site to remember information that changes the way the Site behaves or looks, like your preferred language, theme (light/dark mode), and currency selection.",
    "seo.privacy.analytics_cookies_title": "Analytics Cookies (Optional)",
    "seo.privacy.analytics_cookies_desc":
      "We may use anonymous analytics cookies to understand how visitors interact with our Site. These cookies collect information in an anonymous form, including the number of visitors, where visitors come from, and the pages they visit. You can opt out of these cookies at any time.",
    "seo.privacy.no_tracking":
      "We do NOT use: advertising cookies, tracking cookies, social media cookies, or third-party marketing cookies. You can control cookies through your browser settings at any time.",
    "seo.privacy.third_party":
      "<h2>Third-Party Services</h2><p>Our Site may contain links to third-party websites and services that are not operated by us. We have no control over and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services.</p><p>We currently use the following third-party services:</p><ul><li><strong>Google Fonts:</strong> For typography. Google may collect limited data as per their privacy policy.</li><li><strong>Font Awesome:</strong> For icons. Font Awesome may collect limited data as per their privacy policy.</li><li><strong>Ethical Advertising Partners:</strong> We may display ads from partners who adhere to strict privacy standards. These partners may use cookies to serve relevant ads.</li></ul><p>We strongly advise you to review the Privacy Policy of every site you visit. We encourage you to read the privacy policies of these third-party services to understand their data practices.</p>",
    "seo.privacy.security":
      "<h2>Data Security</h2><p>The security of your personal information is important to us. We implement a variety of security measures to maintain the safety of your personal information when you enter, submit, or access your personal information.</p><p>However, no method of transmission over the Internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your personal information, we cannot guarantee its absolute security. We regularly review our security practices and update them as needed to protect against emerging threats.</p>",
    "seo.privacy.rights_title": "Your Privacy Rights",
    "seo.privacy.right1_title": "Right to Access",
    "seo.privacy.right1_desc":
      "Request a copy of any personal data we hold about you.",
    "seo.privacy.right2_title": "Right to Deletion",
    "seo.privacy.right2_desc":
      "Request that we delete any personal data we hold about you.",
    "seo.privacy.right3_title": "Right to Correction",
    "seo.privacy.right3_desc":
      "Request that we correct any inaccurate personal data.",
    "seo.privacy.right4_title": "Right to Opt-Out",
    "seo.privacy.right4_desc":
      "Opt out of analytics collection and non-essential cookies.",
    "seo.privacy.right5_title": "Right to Portability",
    "seo.privacy.right5_desc":
      "Request your data in a machine-readable format.",
    "seo.privacy.right6_title": "Right to Complain",
    "seo.privacy.right6_desc":
      "File a complaint with your local data protection authority.",
    "seo.privacy.children":
      "<h2>Children's Privacy</h2><p>Our Site is not intended for use by children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and you are aware that your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately.</p><p>If we become aware that we have collected personal information from children under 13 without verification of parental consent, we will take steps to remove that information from our servers. We encourage parents and guardians to monitor their children's online activities and to help enforce this Privacy Policy by instructing their children never to provide personal information on our Site without their permission.</p>",
    "seo.privacy.international":
      "<h2>International Users</h2><p>Our Site is accessible from countries around the world. If you access our Site from outside the country where our servers are located, please be aware that your information may be transferred to, stored, and processed in a country where data protection laws may differ from those of your country.</p><p>By using our Site, you consent to the transfer of your information to our servers, which may be located in a different country. We will take all steps reasonably necessary to ensure that your data is treated securely and in accordance with this Privacy Policy, regardless of where it is stored.</p>",
    "seo.privacy.changes":
      '<h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2><p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this Privacy Policy.</p><p>We advise you to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes. Changes to this Privacy Policy are effective when they are posted on this page. Your continued use of our Site after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated Privacy Policy.</p><p>If we make material changes to this Privacy Policy, we will provide more prominent notice, including email notification if you have provided us with your email address.</p>',
    "seo.privacy.contact_title": "Questions About This Privacy Policy?",
    "seo.privacy.contact_desc":
      "If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please don't hesitate to contact our Privacy Officer.",
