    "seo.terms.acceptance":
      '<h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2><p>Welcome to Calculator12 ("we," "our," or "us"). These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of our website calculator12.com, including all calculators, tools, features, and content available through the Site (collectively, the "Services").</p><p>By accessing or using our Services, you agree to be bound by these Terms and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, you must not access or use our Services. These Terms apply to all visitors, users, and others who access the Services, including without limitation users who are browsers, registered users, or contributors of content.</p><p>Please read these Terms carefully before using our Services. Your continued use of the Services following the posting of changes to these Terms will constitute your acceptance of such changes.</p>',
    "seo.terms.license":
      "<h2>2. License to Use</h2><p>Subject to your compliance with these Terms, Calculator12 grants you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access and use the Services for your personal, non-commercial purposes. This license does not include any right to:</p><ul><li><strong>Modify or Create Derivative Works:</strong> You may not modify, adapt, translate, or create derivative works based on our Services or any part thereof.</li><li><strong>Redistribute or Republish:</strong> You may not reproduce, duplicate, copy, sell, resell, or exploit any portion of the Services without our express written permission.</li><li><strong>Reverse Engineer:</strong> You may not decompile, reverse engineer, or attempt to derive the source code of any software underlying our Services.</li><li><strong>Remove Proprietary Notices:</strong> You may not remove, alter, or obscure any copyright, trademark, or other proprietary notices from our Services.</li></ul><p>All rights not expressly granted to you in these Terms are reserved by Calculator12 and its licensors.</p>",
    "seo.terms.acceptable_use":
      "<h2>3. Acceptable Use Policy</h2><p>You agree to use our Services only for lawful purposes and in a manner consistent with these Terms. You agree not to use the Services in any way that could damage, disable, overburden, or impair our servers or networks, or interfere with any other party's use and enjoyment of the Services.</p><p>You are responsible for ensuring that your use of the Services complies with all applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances in your jurisdiction. You agree not to use the Services to transmit any material that is unlawful, harmful, threatening, abusive, harassing, defamatory, vulgar, obscene, or otherwise objectionable.</p>",
    "seo.terms.prohibited_title": "4. Prohibited Activities",
