    "seo.cookie.intro":
      "<h2>1. Introduction</h2><p>Welcome to Calculator12's Cookie Policy. This policy explains what cookies are, how we use them on our website calculator12.com (the \"Site\"), the types of cookies we use, and how you can control them. We believe in transparency and want you to understand exactly how we use cookies to enhance your experience.</p><p>By continuing to use our Site, you consent to the use of cookies as described in this policy. If you do not agree with our use of cookies, you should adjust your browser settings accordingly or discontinue use of our Site. This Cookie Policy should be read in conjunction with our <a href='privacy-policy.html'>Privacy Policy</a> and <a href='terms-of-service.html'>Terms of Service</a>.</p>",
    "seo.cookie.what_are":
      "<h2>2. What Are Cookies?</h2><p>Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer, smartphone, tablet, or other device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work more efficiently, provide a better user experience, and give website owners useful information about how their sites are being used.</p><p>Cookies themselves do not contain or collect any personal information that can identify you. However, when combined with other data, they can help us understand how you interact with our Site. Cookies are stored in your web browser and can be accessed by the website that created them on subsequent visits.</p>",
    "seo.cookie.good_news_title": "Good News",
    "seo.cookie.good_news_desc":
      "Calculator12 uses minimal cookies. We prioritize your privacy and only use cookies that are essential for the Site to function properly or that significantly enhance your experience.",
