    "seo.cookie.how_we_use":
      "<h2>5. How We Use Cookies</h2><p>We use cookies for the following specific purposes:</p><ul><li><strong>To Remember Your Preferences:</strong> When you select a language, theme, or currency, we store this in a cookie so you don't have to reselect it every time you visit.</li><li><strong>To Maintain Your Session:</strong> Essential cookies help us keep track of your session as you navigate between different pages of our Site.</li><li><strong>To Improve Performance:</strong> Analytics cookies help us understand which calculators are most popular, which pages have issues, and how we can improve the overall user experience.</li><li><strong>To Ensure Security:</strong> Some cookies help us protect against cross-site request forgery (CSRF) attacks and other security threats.</li><li><strong>To Load Balance:</strong> Technical cookies help us distribute traffic across our servers to ensure fast, reliable performance.</li></ul><p>We do NOT use cookies to: track your browsing history across other websites, build a profile of your interests for advertising purposes, sell your data to third parties, or identify you personally.</p>",
