      "If you opt in to analytics, Google Analytics may set cookies to track your usage of our Site. You can opt out at any time. These cookies are governed by Google's Privacy Policy.",
    "seo.cookie.third_party_note":
      "We have no control over third-party cookies and encourage you to review the privacy policies of these services to understand their data practices. We only work with reputable third-party providers who adhere to strict privacy standards.",
