      "<h2>About This Sitemap</h2><p>This sitemap provides a complete overview of all pages available on Calculator12. It's designed to help users and search engines navigate our website efficiently. We regularly update this sitemap as we add new calculators and pages.</p><p>For the XML sitemap used by search engines, please visit <a href='/sitemap.xml' style='color: #7c3aed; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;'>/sitemap.xml</a>. This XML sitemap helps search engines like Google discover and index all our pages.</p><p>If you're looking for a specific calculator and can't find it here, use our search function or <a href='contact.html' style='color: #7c3aed; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;'>contact our support team</a>. We're always happy to help you find what you need.</p>",
